# Production build configuration, committed on purpose: Workers Builds reads
# this on every push to main. Everything here is public — a GA4 measurement ID
# is printed into every page's HTML — so nothing secret may ever go in this
# file. Secrets belong in the Cloudflare dashboard, never here.
#
# Comma-separated GA4 measurement IDs. The first is the property litekart.in
# also reports to, by the owner's choice, so kitcommerce.store traffic appears
# in that property's reports alongside it. The second is a property dedicated
# to kitcommerce.store alone. Nothing loads until a visitor clicks "Accept
# analytics" — see Consent.astro.
PUBLIC_GA4_ID=G-B9RQTEZWN6,G-9TFDRT5HM3

# WhatsApp contact, international format without the plus. Public by nature:
# it is printed on every page as the floating chat button and a footer link.
PUBLIC_WHATSAPP=918249028220
